   "page_header_en": "Domain Survey (藩制一覧表), Fascicle 2 — Tosa / Kōchi (高知藩): land assessment, taxes, and products",
   "table_number": 2,
   "page_topic": "kokudaka (5-yr avg) + tax + products + households",
   "page_summary_en": "This is the land-and-fiscal page (fascicle 2) for the Tosa domain, entered under its castle-town name Kōchi (高知藩). It records a 草高 (assessed yield) of 495,486 koku, given as a five-year average spanning 1864–1868 (through the Boshin War), with current rice (現米) of 189,431 koku that combines with a further 3,587 koku to a grand total (總計) of 193,018 koku. It also gives the tax in gold and silver and a household count (戸數) of 93,736. A long 諸産物 (assorted products) list catalogues Tosa's named goods without quantities; the domain's population total is on the demographics page.",
   "sequence": 8
  },
  {
   "id": "tosa_demographics",
   "domain_canonical": "土佐藩",
