   "page_header_en": "Domain Survey (藩制一覧表), Fascicle 2 — Tosa / Kōchi (高知藩): population, status classes, and army",
   "table_number": 2,
   "page_topic": "population + status classes (with M/F) + standing army",
   "page_summary_en": "This is Tosa's demographic page (fascicle 2), giving a total population (人口) of 495,936. The status classes each carry male/female sub-totals: 7,269 士族 (samurai) households and 30,506 persons; 3,073 卒族 (lower-retainer) households and 17,681 persons; 3,396 穢多 (outcaste-caste) households and 16,894 persons; a Shinto-priest-and-ascetic class of 1,016 households and 4,214 persons; and 476 temples with 1,572 clergy. The page closes with Tosa's army: 6,600 standing troops (常備兵) and 2,400 emergency troops (非常兵), together 9,000 men.",
   "sequence": 9
  },
  {
   "id": "tosa_tail_kameoka_opening",
