   "page_header_kanji": "藩制一覧表第八 （高知）",
   "page_header_en": "Domain Survey (藩制一覧表), Fascicle 8 — Tosa (高知藩): junior councillors",
   "table_number": 8,
   "page_topic": "Continuation of Tosa (Kōchi) domain's Junior Councillor (少参事) roster — thirteen named officials.",
   "page_summary_en": "This left leaf continues Tosa domain's (高知藩, the Yamauchi domain) officials roster from the facing right leaf, in the eighth fascicle of the survey. A single rank heading, 少参事 (junior councillor), stands atop the rightmost column, and beneath and to its left run thirteen name columns, read right to left, closing with the celebrated Tosa figures Kataoka Kenkichi (片岡健吉) and Tani Tateki (谷干城). There is no ○ domain-boundary marker on this leaf — the boundary between Kagoshima and Kōchi lies on the facing right leaf — so everything here belongs to Tosa, and the list runs on to the next page."
  },
