   "table_number": 8,
   "page_topic": "Kōchi (Tosa) domain junior-councillor (権少参事) roster — left-half overflow of the fascicle-8 officials list",
   "page_summary_en": "A further leaf of Tosa domain's (高知藩) officials roster in the eighth fascicle, made up entirely of names — no figures and no ○ domain-boundary marker. A single rank heading, 権少参事 (provisional junior councillor), sits mid-leaf atop its column. Reading right to left, the six columns to the right of that heading finish the preceding 少参事 (junior councillor) list, while the heading column and the five columns to its left name the six provisional junior councillors."
  },
  {
   "id": "kochi_officials_2",
   "sequence": 14,
   "domain_canonical": "土佐藩",
