   "page_header_kanji": "藩制一覧表第九 （鶴舞、鶴牧）",
   "page_header_en": "Domain Survey (藩制一覧表), Fascicle 9 — Tsurumai (鶴舞藩) and Tsurumaki (鶴牧藩): officials (shared leaf)",
   "table_number": 9,
   "page_topic": "Fascicle-9 domain officials for Tsurumaki, sharing the page with the full Tsurumai officials block and a preceding-domain tail name.",
   "page_summary_en": "This fascicle 9 (officials and military) leaf holds parts of three adjacent crane-named domains, its columns reading right to left. First comes a single tail name belonging to the domain preceding Tsurumai; then the ○鶴舞藩 (Tsurumai) boundary marker introduces Tsurumai's complete officials roster — 大参事 2, 権大参事 4, 少参事 2, 権少参事 4 — and its army of 739 troops (兵隊). Mid-leaf the ○鶴牧藩 (Tsurumaki) marker opens Tsurumaki's own entry, but only its senior councillors appear here: 大参事 (2) and 権大参事 (5). Tsurumaki's remaining ranks and its 120 troops continue on the facing leaf."
  },
  {
   "id": "tsurumaki_military",
   "sequence": 42,
   "domain_canonical": "鶴牧藩",
   "domain_hi_name": "○鶴牧藩 → ○敦賀藩",
   "domain_en": "Tsurumaki",
   "image": "images/lower_p192_left.jpg",
   "volume": "vol2",
