   "book_page": "二百七十三",
   "page_header_kanji": "藩制一覧表第八（岡山）",
   "page_header_en": "Domain Survey (藩制一覧表), Fascicle 8 — Okayama (岡山藩): officials and military",
   "table_number": 8,
   "page_topic": "Okayama-han officials roster (fascicle 8): governor and senior councillor appointees, with the preceding domain's junior-councillors and military tally overflowing to the right of the marker.",
   "page_summary_en": "This leaf opens the officials-and-military entry for Okayama domain (岡山藩) in Fascicle 8, headed by the ○岡山藩 boundary marker. Reading right-to-left, Okayama's own roster lists the governor (知事), the senior councillors (大参事) Tokura and Ikeda, and the associate senior councillors (権大参事), continued on the facing leaf. The military figures to the right of the ○岡山藩 marker — 121 samurai riflemen (銃士), 110 lower-rank riflemen (銃卒), 20 artillery soldiers (砲士), and 2 cannon (大砲) — belong to the previous domain sharing this leaf, Toyotsu (豐津藩), not Okayama. The printed page number in the bottom margin is 273."
  },
  {
   "id": "tottori_upper_p051_right",
   "sequence": 63,
   "domain_canonical": "鳥取藩",
   "domain_hi_name": "鳥取藩",
   "domain_en": "Tottori",
   "image": "images/upper_p051_right.jpg",
