   "book_page": "七十九",
   "page_header_kanji": "藩制一覧表第二（鳥取）",
   "page_header_en": "Domain Survey (藩制一覧表), Fascicle 2 — Tottori (鳥取藩): religious and outcaste households",
   "table_number": 2,
   "page_topic": "Tottori religious/outcaste household counts and populations with male/female splits (Fascicle 2 continuation)",
   "page_summary_en": "This half-page continues Tottori domain's (鳥取藩) demographic register in Fascicle 2 (藩制一覧表第二) of the 1870 Hansei Ichiran. The domain identity carries over from the preceding leaf and no ○ domain-boundary marker appears, so every column here belongs to Tottori. It tabulates households and populations, each split into male (男) and female (女), for a series of religious and outcaste categories: Shinto-priest households (社家戸數) at 750 houses and 1,752 people, Buddhist temples (寺院) at 536 with a population of 2,013, eta (穢多, outcaste) at 1,261 households and 3,783 people, hinin (非人) at 272 households and 816 people, Shugendō ascetics (修驗), onmyōji diviners (陰陽師), and komusō mendicant monks (虚無僧). It closes with a shrine total (神社) of 1,518; the village-count field (村數) is left blank, the source printing the note シレス (\"not known\")."
  },
  {
   "id": "tottori_lower_p142_left",
   "sequence": 67,
   "domain_canonical": "鳥取藩",
   "domain_hi_name": "鳥取藩",
   "domain_en": "Tottori",
   "image": "images/lower_p142_left.jpg",
