   "book_page": "二百五十九",
   "page_header_kanji": "藩制一覽表第八（堀江）",
   "page_header_en": "Table of Domain Administration, Fascicle 8 (Horie)",
   "table_number": 8,
   "page_topic": "Horie-domain officials roster (fascicle 8), with Honjō military/officer overflow",
   "page_summary_en": "This left-hand page of fascicle 8 (officials and military) opens the Horie-domain (堀江藩) entry at the ○堀江藩 marker and lists its administrators: governor (知事) Ōsawa Motohisa; grand councillors (大參事) Uchida Masao and Kanazawa Iwao; acting grand councillor (權大參事) Hamano Hanzō; junior councillors (少參事) Matsumoto Seiji and Niimura Osada; and acting junior councillor (權少參事) Mase Genroku — Ōsawa being the daimyō later punished for the 1868–71 kokudaka-inflation fraud. Everything to the right of the marker belongs to the preceding domain, Honjō (本荘藩, p.258/141R): three trailing officer-name columns and Honjō's troop counts of 197 gunners (銃士) and 235 rank-and-file (兵卒). The running header names Horie as the fascicle's domain (provenance) and the printed page number is 259. NB: the project MASTER mis-assigned Honjō's two troop counts to Horie and shuffled Horie's council seats; the scan is followed here."
  },
  {
   "id": "tokushima_upper_p050_left",
   "sequence": 71,
   "domain_canonical": "徳島藩",
   "domain_hi_name": "徳島藩",
