   "table_number": 8,
   "page_topic": "Tokushima domain officials (chiji through gon-shōsanji) and garrison troop count",
   "page_summary_en": "This is a single-domain page for Tokushima (○徳島藩) in Fascicle 8, which records domain officials and military strength. The upper band carries the rank headings — governor (知事), acting grand councillor (権大参事) with five men, junior councillor (少参事) with two, and acting junior councillor (権少参事) with two — with the appointee names hung in columns below, beginning with the daimyō-governor Hachisuka Mochiaki. A note records that the names of the councillors below grand-councillor rank were not filed, which is why that rank shows no count. The one military figure given is a garrison of 75 troops (兵隊), a partial return consistent with the incomplete roster."
  },
  {
   "id": "kajiyama_upper_p110_right",
   "sequence": 74,
   "domain_canonical": "加知山藩",
   "domain_hi_name": "加知山藩",
