   "page_header_kanji": "藩制一覧表第三（加知山）",
   "page_header_en": "Domain Survey (藩制一覧表), Fascicle 3 — Kajiyama (加知山藩): assessment and demographics",
   "table_number": 3,
   "page_topic": "Kajiyama domain civil register: land assessment (kokudaka/rice), taxes, households, and population.",
   "page_summary_en": "This right half-page opens the entry for Kajiyama domain (加知山藩) in Fascicle 3 of the 1870 Hansei Ichiran, marked by the ○加知山藩 domain-boundary marker; the running header reads 藩制一覧表第三（加知山）. The columns record the principal assessment (本高) of 13,969.897 koku, the five-year-average current tax-rice (現米) of 4,560.116 koku, a small reclamation-license rice line, two cash lines in the 永 (ei) unit, and a combined current-rice subtotal (合現米) of 4,620.587 koku. Demographic figures follow: total households (總戸數) of 3,181, a population (人口) of 16,102 split into 8,031 male (男) and 8,071 female (女), and a shrine-priest count (社家) of 16 households and 83 people. The modest totals are consistent with Kajiyama's status as a small (~14,000-koku) domain."
  },
  {
   "id": "kajiyama_upper_p110_left",
   "sequence": 75,
   "domain_canonical": "加知山藩",
   "domain_hi_name": "加知山藩",
