   "table_number": 8,
   "page_topic": "Domain officials and troop strength (fascicle 8: 職員・兵隊) — tail of Kanbe-han followed by the opening of Kaijiyama-han",
   "page_summary_en": "This Fascicle 8 page, which records officials and military strength, carries two domains. The upper register completes the entry for the previous domain sharing the leaf, Kanbe (神戸藩, Ise): its councillor ranks (権大参事, 少参事, 権少参事), a garrison of 75 troops (兵隊), and seven appointee names hung below, one seat marked vacant (一員欠). The ○加知山藩 domain-boundary marker then opens the primary domain of this page, Kajiyama, whose own officials follow in the lower register: the governor (知事, no name printed here), a grand councillor (大参事), and two acting grand councillors (権大参事). The running header names 加知山."
  },
  {
   "id": "yonezawa_upper_p110_left",
   "sequence": 77,
   "domain_canonical": "米澤藩",
