   "pdf_page": 118,
   "page_side": "R",
   "book_page": "二百十",
   "page_header_kanji": "藩制一覧表第三 (高松)",
   "page_header_en": "Domain Survey (藩制一覧表), Fascicle 3 — Takamatsu (高松藩): population and households",
   "table_number": 3,
   "page_topic": "Takamatsu domain population, household, and status-group counts (士族/卒族/平民/寺社/穢多非人) with a residual land figure",
   "page_summary_en": "This leaf holds the demographic portion of the Fascicle 3 register for Takamatsu domain (高松藩). It records a total population (人員) of 305,191 and 72,582 households (戸數), broken down by status group: samurai (士族, 701 households / 10,122 persons), lower retainers (卒族, 4,486 households / 17,851 persons), commoners (平民, 63,870), and religious and outcaste groups — 289 Shinto shrines (神社), 347 Buddhist temples (寺院), shrine families (社家, 204), mountain ascetics (修驗, 121), and the outcaste groups eta (穢多, 930 households) and hinin (非人, 346 households). The rightmost column carries a tax-exempt-land (除地) figure of 2,696 koku, and the five-year-average yield is noted as undetermined (五ヶ年平均高不詳)."
  },
  {
   "id": "takamatsu_upper_p118_left",
