   "pdf_page": 73,
   "page_side": "L",
   "book_page": "百二十一",
   "page_header_kanji": "藩制一覧表第二（大洲）",
   "page_header_en": "Domain Survey (藩制一覧表), Fascicle 2 — Ozu (大洲藩): population and status classes",
   "table_number": 2,
   "page_topic": "Ozu domain civil register: households by status class, population totals with male/female splits, plus shrines, temples, and troops",
   "page_summary_en": "This half-page continues the civil and demographic register (fascicle 2) for Ozu domain (大洲藩) in Iyo province; the running header 藩制一覧表第二（大洲）confirms the domain, and with no ○ domain-boundary marker on the leaf it carries on from the preceding page. It gives household and population counts by status class — 士族 (samurai) 263 households / 1,130 people, 卒族 (lower retainers) 352 / 1,368, 輕卒 (light foot soldiers) 630 / 2,520 — each with a male/female split, and a whole-domain total of 22,771 households and 93,603 people (男 47,791 / 女 45,812). The sheet also records 921 outcaste (穢多) households, 1,342 shrines (神社), 1,045 temples (寺), and 730 troops (兵隊), with priest and clergy sub-counts noted in the margins."
  },
  {
   "id": "ozu_lower_p152_right",
   "sequence": 157,
   "domain_canonical": "大洲藩",
   "domain_hi_name": "大洲藩",
   "domain_en": "Ozu",
   "image": "images/lower_p152_right.jpg",
   "volume": "vol2",
   "pdf_page": 152,
   "page_side": "R",
   "book_page": "二百八十",
   "page_header_kanji": "藩制一覧表第八（忍）",
   "page_header_en": "Domain Survey (藩制一覧表), Fascicle 8 — Ozu (大洲藩) officials and troops; Oshi (忍藩) opening",
   "table_number": 8,
   "page_topic": "officials_and_military",
   "page_summary_en": "This is an officials-and-military page (fascicle 8, 職員兵隊) that carries two domains on one leaf. Reading right to left, the material to the right of the single ○忍藩 (Oshi domain) marker completes Ozu domain (大洲藩): its military establishment — an infantry force of two battalions, one artillery company (大砲一隊), and six cannon (大砲) — together with its named councillors. The columns to the left of the ○忍藩 marker open Oshi's own entry, listing one governor (知事), two senior councillors (大参事), two acting senior councillors (権大参事), and four junior councillors (少参事). The running header reads 忍 and the printed page number in the bottom margin is 二百八十 (280)."
  },
  {
   "id": "ozu_lower_p152_left",
   "sequence": 158,
   "domain_canonical": "大洲藩",
   "domain_hi_name": "大洲藩",
   "domain_en": "Ozu",
   "image": "images/lower_p152_left.jpg",
