   "page_header_en": "Domain Survey (藩制一覧表), Fascicle 8 — Ozu (大洲藩): officials, with previous domain's troops",
   "table_number": 8,
   "page_topic": "Domain officials (職員) and military establishment (兵隊) — Fascicle 8",
   "page_summary_en": "This officials-and-military page (fascicle 8) opens the entry for Ozu domain (大洲藩) at the ○大洲藩 boundary marker. Below the marker are the administrative ranks — 知事 (governor, no name printed here), 大参事 (senior councillor, 2 members: Ōhashi Shigeyuki and Nakamura Toshio) and 権大参事 (acting senior councillor, 4 members: Yamamoto Mayumi, Kodama Kiyoshi, Hori Hiroma, and Kumoide Azusa). The military figures printed to the right of the ○大洲藩 marker (roughly fourteen companies of about forty men, one of them artillery) belong to the previous domain sharing this leaf, whose own marker fell on the preceding page, not to Ozu. The running header reads 藩制一覧表第八（大洲）and the bottom-margin page number is 二百八十一 (281)."
  },
  {
   "id": "ozu_lower_p153_right",
   "sequence": 159,
   "domain_canonical": "大洲藩",
   "domain_hi_name": "大洲藩",
   "domain_en": "Ozu",
   "image": "images/lower_p153_right.jpg",
