   "page_summary_en": "This officials-and-military page (fascicle 8) carries two domains. The ○龜山藩 marker and the officials roster in the main body belong to Kameyama domain (龜山藩): its ranks are 知事 (governor, no name printed here), 大参事 (senior councillor, Kondō Takuzan), 権大参事 (acting senior councillor, Katō Tomohiko and Kondō Yukitome), and 少参事 (junior councillor, Hosoki Masayuki). Everything to the right of the ○龜山藩 marker belongs to the previous domain sharing this leaf, Kawagoe (川越藩): five overflow official-name columns and Kawagoe's full military block — an infantry battalion of 360 men (six 60-man platoons), 80 infantry reserves, 30 artillerymen, and a 32-man artillery company. The running header reads 藩制一覧表第八（龜山）and the bottom-margin page number is 308."
