   "page_summary_en": "This is a continuation page of the civil register (fascicle 2) for Kawagoe domain (川越藩), book page 162; the running header reads 藩制一覧表第二（川越）and there is no ○ domain-boundary marker on the leaf, so all of it belongs to Kawagoe. It records land-tax residuals in cash (永 446 kan), silver (銀 3,105.33 monme), and copper coin (錢 1,952 mon); a total of 11,650 households (戸數) and 57,623 people (人口, 男 28,887 / 女 28,736); shrine-priest households (社家, 44 with a resident population of 173); 142 temples (寺) with 333 resident clergy and 75 unoccupied temples (無住寺); 190 villages (村數); and outcaste populations of 713 (穢多) and 46 (非人), households not separately recorded."
  },
