   "page_summary_en": "This leaf opens the entry for Kasama domain (its ○ marker and land assessment), but the bulk of the page — read right to left, to the right of that marker — is the demographic tail of the previous domain, Kawagoe (川越藩). The Kawagoe figures shown here give its samurai and lower-retainer classes: 士族 (samurai households) 571 / 2,447 people (男 1,179 / 女 1,268) and 卒族 (lower retainers) 447 / 1,416 (男 736 / 女 680), followed by a military note of 597 elite troops (精兵) and 212 auxiliary troops (聚合兵)."
