   "page_summary_en": "This is the officials-and-military page (fascicle 8) for Kawagoe domain (川越藩), opened by its ○川越藩 marker. It lists the administrative ranks — 知事 (governor, heading only, no name printed here), 大参事 (senior councillor, 3), 権大参事 (acting senior councillor, 3), 少参事 (junior councillor, 2), and 権少参事 (acting junior councillor, the named appointees Norimatsu Shidō and Horie Shinzō) — followed by the military establishment: eight infantry platoons (歩兵, about 320 men), a three-section artillery company (大砲隊), a cannon unit of 98 (砲隊), a rifle corps of 499 (銃隊), and a combined reserve of 210 (聚合隊). A small note in the right margin records a variant reading in which there is no acting junior councillor and the junior councillors instead number three. The running header and page number (三百九 = 309) sit in the outer margin."
  },
