   "page_summary_en": "This leaf is the Fascicle 3 civil and economic register for Takasaki (高崎藩). Reading right to left, it opens with a 兵員 (military head-count) block of 240 corps officials, 384 soldiers, and 768 troopers. The ○ domain-boundary marker introduces the land figures: an assessed yield 草高 (kokudaka) of 82,000 koku, a supplementary yield 外高 of 8,573.5401 koku, and a combined total 合高 of 90,573.5401 koku. The lower registers give the 正租 (regular land tax) of 32,653.59 koku of rice plus cash and gold, and the 雜稅 (miscellaneous tax) of 45.93 koku of rice plus smaller cash and gold amounts."
