   "page_summary_en": "This Fascicle 8 leaf belongs entirely to Takasaki (高崎藩), continuing the officials roster begun on the facing page; it carries no new ○ domain-boundary marker. The header column records the domain's 兵員 (military strength) as 735 persons. The tail of the councillor list appears here: a block of six holdover names, followed by the 権少参事 (acting junior councillor) heading with its count of five and its five named appointees. A small interlinear note flags that two of the men have no recorded given names and that one is entered at the 権少参事 rank."
