   "page_topic": "Tatebayashi domain population by status class, clergy, outcaste groups, villages/towns, and troop strength",
   "page_summary_en": "This leaf continues the civil register for Tatebayashi domain (館林藩), breaking the population into status categories with male and female sub-totals: samurai (士族) 1,525, lower retainers (卒族) 2,980, shrine-priest families (社家) 143, mountain ascetics (修験) 94, commoners (平民) 67,589, temple clergy (寺院) 654, four nuns (尼), crematory workers (煙亡) 89, eta (穢多) outcastes 1,845, and hinin (非人) 134. It also records 125 villages (村数) and 18 towns (町数), and a military establishment of soldiers plus 637 foot-soldiers (兵卒) organized as sixteen platoons of forty. Because the domain's heading appears on its opening leaf, no ○ marker or governor's name is printed here."
  },
  {
