   "table_number": 8,
   "page_topic": "Officials establishment (職員) for Tatebayashi and Daishōji domains — administrative-officer ranks with counts; military not disclosed for Tatebayashi",
   "page_summary_en": "This fascicle-8 officials leaf (職員) carries two domains. The first is Tatebayashi (○館林藩), whose officer establishment is given as rank headings with counts: a governor (知事, heading only, no name printed), one senior councillor (大参事), four acting senior councillors (権大参事), seven junior councillors (少参事), and six acting junior councillors (権少参事); its troop strength (兵員) is marked as not recorded (記セス). The lower left opens the next domain, Daishōji (○大聖寺藩), listing its senior councillor Maeda Kan (前田幹) and four acting senior councillors — Aoike Yaemon (青池彌右衞門), Tamaru Morie (田丸守衞), Isshiki Kiyoshi (一色清), and Kōsaka Kuemon (上坂九右衞門). Daishōji's remaining figures continue on the facing leaf."
  },
  {
   "id": "tatebayashi_lower_p179_left",
