   "table_number": 8,
   "page_topic": "Domain officials (職員) and military establishment (兵隊) — Fascicle 8",
   "page_summary_en": "This fascicle-8 officials-and-military leaf is dominated by Tatebayashi domain (館林藩), whose ○ marker opens a full administrative roster read right to left: a governor (知事), two senior councillors (大参事), six acting senior councillors (権大参事), five junior councillors (少参事), six acting junior councillors (権少参事), and a standing force (常備兵) of 1,249 men. The military and officials figures printed to the right of Tatebayashi's ○ marker — a force (兵隊) of two battalions of six companies each and an artillery corps (砲隊) of 98 men and 8 guns, together with the junior-councillor appointees Inagaki Awa (稲垣淡) and Ikoma Kazuhiko (生駒一彦) — belong to the previous domain sharing this leaf, not to Tatebayashi. At bottom left the next domain, Takatsuki (○高槻藩), opens, with its senior-councillor post (大参事) noted as vacant for the time being (當分欠官)."
  },
  {
   "id": "nakamura_upper_p159_left",
