   "page_header_en": "Domain Survey (藩制一覧表), Fascicle 4 — Nakamura / Sōma (中村藩): land, revenue, and population",
   "table_number": 4,
   "page_topic": "Civil/economic register (kokudaka, gendaka, tax breakdown, population, households, status counts) for Nakamura (Soma) domain",
   "page_summary_en": "This leaf is the civil and economic register for Nakamura (Sōma) domain (中村藩), opened by the ○ domain-boundary marker in the fourth fascicle of the survey. It records an assessed yield (高) of 83,809.0 koku and a current-rice figure (現米) of 36,423.7 koku, with a two-part revenue breakdown: a regular land tax (正租) of 29,397.1 koku (a five-year average from Bunkyū 3 to Keiō 3) and miscellaneous tax (雑税納) of 6,935.2 koku. Demographic and status data follow — a total population (人員) of 63,893, total households (戸数) of 9,638, samurai households (士族) of 1,937, and eight kazoku (華族, nobility) persons. A note in the header records the troop strength as 1,059 samurai and 878 lower retainers (卒) plus an artillery corps."
  },
  {
   "id": "nakamura_upper_p160_right",
   "sequence": 184,
   "domain_canonical": "中村藩",
   "domain_hi_name": "中村藩",
   "domain_en": "Nakamura",
   "image": "images/upper_p160_right.jpg",
