   "pdf_page": 232,
   "page_side": "L",
   "book_page": "四百四十一",
   "page_header_kanji": "藩制一覽表第九（清崎）",
   "page_header_en": "Han Institutions at a Glance, Fascicle 9 (Kiyosaki)",
   "table_number": 9,
   "page_topic": "Kiyosaki domain officials roster and troop strength",
   "page_summary_en": "This page carries the fascicle-9 entry for Kiyosaki Domain (Echigo), preceded at the right edge by the tail of the previous domain's military return: Kiyosue Domain's artillery of two half-platoons at ten men each, that is twenty gunners, plus two duty officers. Below the domain marker, Kiyosaki's official roster lists fourteen men filled column-major by rank: two senior councillors (Eda Gen'ichiro and Nakamura Sohachi), three acting senior councillors (Kato Tamotsu, Menju Kozaburo, Hagiwara Jun), five junior councillors (Maehara, Kurokawa, Narita, Takeshima Yasushi, Ii Han'ya), and four acting junior councillors (Shigeta Kiheiji, Hatta Ichi, Saito Wataru, Ogawa). Kiyosaki's own force is recorded as 48 shizoku and 48 sotsu, 96 men in all. A second heading at the foot of the page, \"junior councillors, per the resident officer's report,\" supplies the five junior councillors' full personal names, and a collator's note records that one version of the text omits Ogawa."
  },
  {
   "id": "kitsuregawa_lower_p065_left",
   "sequence": 368,
   "domain_canonical": "喜連川藩",
   "domain_hi_name": "喜連川藩",
   "domain_en": "Kitsuregawa",
   "image": "images/lower_p065_left.jpg",
