   "page_header_kanji": "藩制一覽表第八（牟原）",
   "page_header_en": "Domain Survey Table, fascicle 8 (Muhara)",
   "table_number": 8,
   "page_topic": "Domain officials roster and troop strength (fascicle 8)",
   "page_summary_en": "Fascicle-8 (officials and military) leaf for Muhara domain (牟原藩, as printed). The right-hand columns, standing to the right of the ○牟原藩 marker, are the tail of the preceding domain Hayashida (林田藩): its provisional-senior and junior councillors (surnames 北條・石野・北條・岡本) and its troop strength of about 200 combat soldiers, with one platoon reckoned at roughly fifty men. Left of the marker, Muhara's own roster is laid out in two registers: the senior posts 知事 (governor, no name printed), 執政 Baba Hyōemon, and 參政 (Tsunashima Namie and Suzuki Tsutau), above a lower register tallying the four secretary grades — 大參事 2, 權大參事 4 (Oda Rokurobei), 少參事 5 (Kosuge Jūrobei), and 權少參事 2 (Mukai Sakunoshin). Printed book page 248."
  },
  {
