   "page_header_kanji": "藩制一覽表第八（西端）",
   "page_header_en": "Table of Domain Administration (Hansei Ichiran), Fascicle 8 (Nishihata) — running header / provenance only; it names Nishihata, the domain whose marker opens on this page, while the right-hand columns belong to the preceding domain.",
   "table_number": 8,
   "page_topic": "Domain officials and militia (fascicle 8)",
   "page_summary_en": "This fascicle-8 (officials) page opens the entry for Nishihata Domain (西端藩), a ~10,000-koku Mikawa house. Its marker ○西端藩 sits mid-page; to its left Nishihata records its council establishment — 知事 (governor, no count printed), 大參事 2, 權大參事 2, 少參事 3 — together with five named councillors (飯田潤平, 岡田謙三郎, 土方新太郎, 秋元蘋, 鈴木幾太郎). Everything right of the marker is the overflowing tail of the preceding domain, Niiya (新谷藩): its 大參事 徳田儀一, 權大參事 平野正臣, and two 少參事 (小泉正澄, 香渡正重), plus Niiya's militia — 藩兵 二小隊 (this unit over 100 men) and 農兵 二小隊 (likewise, but formed of light foot-soldiers/軽卒). Nishihata's own troops (兵隊, 37 samurai / 48 sotsu) and its 權少參事 continue on the facing half-page (p.257). Printed book-page number: 256."
  },
  {
   "id": "nishiohira_lower_p140_left",
   "sequence": 536,
   "domain_canonical": "西大平藩",
