   "page_header_en": "Han Administrative Survey, Fascicle 8 (Nishiōhira)",
   "table_number": 8,
   "page_topic": "Domain officials and troop strength (fascicle 8)",
   "page_summary_en": "This is fascicle 8 (domain officials and military) with running provenance 西大平藩 (Nishiōhira, a ~10,000-koku Ōoka-family domain in Mikawa), printed page 257. Left of the ○西大平藩 marker the domain records a governor (知事, no count glyph printed), one Senior Councillor (大参事), two Acting Senior Councillors (權大参事), and two Junior Councillors (少参事), with the officials' names (郷正巳, 篠崎正吾, 岩崎俊, 大岡貞雄, 須藤直衞) listed at the foot. The right half of the page carries the overflow tail of the preceding domain 西端藩 (Nishibata): its Acting Junior Councillors (權少参事, 3 members) and troop strength (兵隊: 37 shi and 48 sotsu, 85 total), plus five 西端 officials' names. The facing page (lower_p140_right, p.256) confirms the 西端 heading and marker, fixing the domain order as 西端 → 西大平."
  },
  {
   "id": "honjo_upper_p048_left",
   "sequence": 537,
   "domain_canonical": "本荘藩",
   "domain_hi_name": "本庄藩",
   "domain_en": "Honjō",
   "image": "images/upper_p048_left.jpg",
