   "page_side": "L",
   "book_page": "四百七",
   "page_header_kanji": "藩制一覽表第五（敦賀）",
   "page_header_en": "Hansei ichiran-hyō, Fascicle Five (Tsuruga)",
   "table_number": 5,
   "page_topic": "Tsuruga assessed yield, land taxes, and household counts",
   "page_summary_en": "This page continues the fascicle-five entry for Tsuruga domain from the facing recto, and no maru-marker appears anywhere on the sheet, so every column belongs to Tsuruga. It closes the yield accounting with 480.44422 koku of komidaka and 117.8605 koku of newly reclaimed paddy and dry field, giving a total assessed yield (合高) of 9,416.36717 koku, beside which the 1928 editors printed a warichu note stating that the original miscalculates and that the fractional tail should read 六合九勺 rather than 七合一勺七才. The tax columns record a regular rice tax of 4,315.1566 koku plus 496.09726 koku drawn from exchanged land, and a miscellaneous tax of 66.59957 koku of rice, 654 ryō 2 bu together with 281.492 eiraku mon in cash, and further exchanged-land shares of 9.378 koku and 12,948.7 mon. Households number 1,799, of which 253 households and six temples lie on exchanged land, with 48 shizoku and 71 sotsu households counted separately."
  },
  {
   "id": "tsuruga_upper_p217_right",
   "sequence": 853,
   "domain_canonical": "敦賀藩",
   "domain_hi_name": "敦賀藩",
   "domain_en": "Tsuruga",
   "image": "images/upper_p217_right.jpg",
   "volume": "vol1",
   "pdf_page": 217,
   "page_side": "R",
   "book_page": "四百八",
   "page_header_kanji": "藩制一覽表第五（松岡）",
   "page_header_en": "Table of Domain Institutions, Fascicle 5 (Matsuoka)",
   "table_number": 5,
   "page_topic": "Shrines, temples and population by status (Tsuruga); Matsuoka's land assessment and regular tax",
   "page_summary_en": "This page closes the Tsuruga (敦賀藩) entry in fascicle 5 and opens that of Matsuoka (松岡藩). Tsuruga is credited with one shrine and seventy temples, and a population of 7,584 (3,769 male, 3,815 female), within which the survey itemises 149 shizoku, 168 sotsu, 7 shrine people and 89 temple people; a bracketed note assigns 1,052 of the total to land the domain received in exchange (替地), although the note's own male and female figures sum to 1,034 and the compiler set a dot beside each of the two doubtful digits. A second bracketed note under the sotsu figure records that the original manuscript's total was miscalculated and that the printed figure follows the itemised breakdown, 97 men plus 71 women. Left of the ○松岡藩 marker, Matsuoka's entry begins: its 草高 is given as 不分, not itemised, and its regular tax as 3,824.41875 koku of hulled rice together with 666 kan 623.5 mon in cash."
  },
  {
   "id": "niwase_upper_p044_left",
   "sequence": 854,
   "domain_canonical": "庭瀬藩",
   "domain_hi_name": "庭瀬藩",
   "domain_en": "Niwase",
   "image": "images/upper_p044_left.jpg",
   "volume": "vol1",
   "pdf_page": 44,
   "page_side": "L",
   "book_page": "六十三",
   "page_header_kanji": "藩制一覽表第一（庭瀬）",
   "page_header_en": "Table of Domain Institutions, Fascicle 1 (Niwase)",
   "table_number": 1,
   "page_topic": "Niwase land assessment, tax, households and status-group population",
   "page_summary_en": "This leaf carries the fascicle-1 economic and demographic block for Niwase domain in Bitchū province, a 20,000-koku Itakura holding whose surveyed gross yield (草高) was 20,573.78265 koku. Regular land tax in rice came to 10,424.9424 koku and miscellaneous cash taxes to 330 ryō 355.34 mon; converted at the eight-ryō rate printed in the margin, the two sum exactly to the recorded combined total of 10,466.23681 koku. The domain reported 4,723 households and 20,381 commoners (10,596 male, 9,785 female), and separately 162 shizoku households with 502 persons, 168 sotsu households with 416 persons, 163 eta households with 861 persons, and 19 hinin households (locally called chasen) with 81 persons. Fifty-eight shrines are recorded, staffed by 52 attendants in 19 households; the printed sotsu total of 416 does not match its own male and female components, which sum to 446."
  },
  {
   "id": "nishioji_upper_p045_left",
   "sequence": 855,
   "domain_canonical": "西大路藩",
   "domain_hi_name": "西大路藩",
